`Art 113(a) Chapters I and II apply from` MEANS Date 2 2 2025

@ref Art 113 third paragraph point (a) exception: Article 5(1) points (ba), (bb), 5(1a), 5(1b)
`Art 113(a) the Article 5 additions apply from` MEANS Date 2 12 2026

-- src:1662 | (b) Chapter III Section 4, Chapter V, Chapter VII and Chapter XII and Article 78 shall apply from 2 August 2025, with the exception of Article 101;
@ref Art 113 third paragraph point (b) (src:1662)
`Art 113(b) the group of Chapter III Section 4, Chapters V, VII, XII and Article 78 applies from` MEANS Date 2 8 2025

-- src:1664 | (c) Chapter III, Sections 1, 2, and 3, with the exception of Article 6(5), shall apply from:
